scn 1
# explore-idle-1024 (perf follow-up D, timing only): the map-sized part of World::updateExplorationPlane.
# A flat 1024x1024 map (exploration plane 512x512 = 262144 cells) and 16 idle bodies: after the first
# tick no footprint changes cell, so SIMPHASE explore= is what the pass costs whatever the units do. Until
# D the pass rebuilt its block summaries from the whole plane every tick; since D it keeps them.
# Run with tools/scenarios/perf-explore/run.sh or wall.sh (base vs candidate on the timing cores).
name explore-idle-1024
ticks 600
seed 7
players 2
weapons off
explored none
map flat 1024 1024
type r roster
group A 0 r 8 rect 20 20 40 40
group B 1 r 8 rect 984 984 1004 1004
